# This folder contains 1 file and 2 sub folders:

## Note that all files inside memory/ but outside of agent/ and skills/ would/should be treated
## as immutables and can also be read by the agent

1. rules.md
    - Hardcoded rules set by you, about your whole persona
    - Agent/detector will read it and never will/won't be able to make a change in it

2. agent/
    - storage space for memory and projects of the agent
3. skills/
    - storage space for memory and projects of the skills
    - slop_detector/
        - storage space for memory and projects of the slop_detector
